%%{init: {"sequence": {"actorWidth": 190, "actorMargin": 70, "messageMargin": 32}}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant A as Alice UI
    participant AG as Alice local Gun
    participant CM as Discovery + Connection Manager
    participant BG as Bob local Gun
    participant IN as Bob intake policy
    participant CB as Bob local chatbot
    participant B as Bob UI

    A->>AG: Create and persist SEA-authored Talk
    AG->>CM: Signed Talk offer with safe metadata
    CM->>IN: Deliver over any permitted working route
    IN->>IN: Apply block, room, language, distance and content policy

    alt Talk rejected
        IN-->>CM: Reject or ignore
    else Talk accepted
        IN->>CM: Request authorized Talk graph
        CM->>BG: Gun Wire synchronizes Talk
        BG->>BG: Commit and verify by read-back
        BG-->>AG: Signed persisted-acceptance receipt
        BG->>CB: Evaluate accepted questions
        CB->>CB: Compare with private answer memory

        alt Exact reusable answer and auto policy permits
            CB->>BG: Store chatbot-reuse response + provenance
        else Missing or changed questions
            CB->>B: Present differential draft / request missing answers
            B->>BG: Approve or enter response
        else Manual mode
            CB->>B: Present draft only
            B->>BG: Review and submit
        end

        BG->>BG: SEA-sign and pair-encrypt response
        BG->>CM: Synchronize pair-private response graph
        CM->>AG: Deliver over direct, relayed, forwarded or mailbox path
        AG->>AG: Persist response and calculate match
        AG-->>A: Display answer, match and conversation state
    end
